{
    "title": "Widget Lab:Wallpapers & Themes",
    "description": "\u300cWidget Lab\u300d is a collection of desktop beautification tools. Here, you can enjoy 200+ meticulously designed custom widgets and 10,000+ beautifully updated daily wallpapers, icons, themes, and lock screens. With our special features listed below, you can personalize your device in ways you've never experienced before!\r\n\r\nSpecial Features:\r\n\r\n\u3010Desktop Widgets\u3011Including 200+ distinct styled and functional widgets, such as vinyl music widgets, photo frame widgets, couple widgets, mood recording widgets, and so on. There are more ways for you to discover!\r\n\u3010Headphone Popup\u3011Tired of the same old system headphone connection popup? No worries, we provide beautiful headphone animations! Not only supporting all headphone models on the market, but also encouraging you to DIY your headphone connection popup!\r\n\u3010Charging Animation\u3011Imagine being able to see cool charging animations or your favorite characters every time you charge your phone? Get rid of the native system charging effect, and make every charging process a delight with us!\r\n\u3010Desktop Beautification\u301110,000+ beautifully updated daily wallpapers, icons, themes, and lock screens that show off your personality on your desktop!\r\n\u3010Voice Photo\u3011Want your favorite anime character or idol to say good morning to you? Add them to your desktop now!\r\n\u3010Dynamic Island\u3011Experience the latest iPhone's Dynamic island function on your Android device! When your device is charging, receiving message notifications, or playing music, it better reminds you by the way of Dynamic island.\r\n\u3010Standby Display\u3011Aren't you wishing to use the Standby function of iPhone 15 on your Android device? Let the Widget Box become your preferred desktop matching artifact!\r\n\r\nDisclosure\uff1a\r\nWith the accessibility permission ,you can realize the pop-up window is not obscured by the status bar and displayed at the top of the phone interface hierarchy for better display and better experience. Please rest assured that we do not collect any information through this permission.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u300cWidget Lab\u300d is a collection of desktop beautification tools. Here, you can enjoy 200+ meticulously designed custom widgets and 10,000+ beautifully updated daily wallpapers, icons, themes, and lock screens. With our special features listed below, you can personalize your device in ways you&#39;ve never experienced before!<br><br>Special Features:<br><br>\u3010Desktop Widgets\u3011Including 200+ distinct styled and functional widgets, such as vinyl music widgets, photo frame widgets, couple widgets, mood recording widgets, and so on. There are more ways for you to discover!<br>\u3010Headphone Popup\u3011Tired of the same old system headphone connection popup? No worries, we provide beautiful headphone animations! Not only supporting all headphone models on the market, but also encouraging you to DIY your headphone connection popup!<br>\u3010Charging Animation\u3011Imagine being able to see cool charging animations or your favorite characters every time you charge your phone? Get rid of the native system charging effect, and make every charging process a delight with us!<br>\u3010Desktop Beautification\u301110,000+ beautifully updated daily wallpapers, icons, themes, and lock screens that show off your personality on your desktop!<br>\u3010Voice Photo\u3011Want your favorite anime character or idol to say good morning to you? Add them to your desktop now!<br>\u3010Dynamic Island\u3011Experience the latest iPhone&#39;s Dynamic island function on your Android device! When your device is charging, receiving message notifications, or playing music, it better reminds you by the way of Dynamic island.<br>\u3010Standby Display\u3011Aren&#39;t you wishing to use the Standby function of iPhone 15 on your Android device? Let the Widget Box become your preferred desktop matching artifact!<br><br>Disclosure\uff1a<br>With the accessibility permission ,you can realize the pop-up window is not obscured by the status bar and displayed at the top of the phone interface hierarchy for better display and better experience. Please rest assured that we do not collect any information through this permission.",
